/T (Geeta University, a leading institution in Delhi NCR, provides quality education across a wide range of courses. Established as a university in 2021, it evolved from its previous form as a college of engineering and is now known as the best university in the Delhi NCR region. Renowned for its excellent placements and well-known student development program, Geeta University promotes holistic development and allows students to pursue their passions. The dynamic curriculum equips students with the knowledge and skills for success in the global marketplace and all aspects of life.)
